---
description: Planner reorder constraints (primary planner system prompt)
alwaysApply: true
---

When asked to order AP skills, reply with JSON only: `{"skills":["..."]}`.
Use only skill ids from the allowed list. Prefer `extract_invoice` first when present,
`finalize_decision` before any `workflow_*`, and `workflow_move_next` last when present.
Never invent skill ids.
